markdown# React 컴포넌트 작성 규칙

## 컴포넌트 구조

### 1. 기본 템플릿

```typescript
import React from 'react';
import type { ReactNode } from 'react';

type ComponentNameProps = {
  // Required props
  id: string;
  name: string;

  // Optional props
  description?: string;
  onAction?: (id: string) => void;

  // Children
  children?: ReactNode;
};

export function ComponentName({
  id,
  name,
  description,
  onAction,
  children,
}: ComponentNameProps) {
  // 1. Hooks
  const [isOpen, setIsOpen] = React.useState(false);

  // 2. Event handlers
  const handleClick = React.useCallback(() => {
    onAction?.(id);
  }, [id, onAction]);

  // 3. Derived state
  const displayName = React.useMemo(() => {
    return name.toUpperCase();
  }, [name]);

  // 4. Effects
  React.useEffect(() => {
    // side effects
  }, []);

  // 5. Early returns
  if (!id) {
    return null;
  }

  // 6. JSX
  return (
    <div>
      {displayName}
      {description && <span>{description}</span>}
      {children}
    </div>
  );
}

// 7. Display name (개발 도구용)
ComponentName.displayName = 'ComponentName';
```

## 최적화

### React.memo

```typescript
// ✅ Props가 자주 변하지 않는 컴포넌트
export const PlaceCard = React.memo(({ place }: { place: Place }) => {
  return <div>{place.name}</div>;
});

// Custom comparison (필요한 경우만)
export const PlaceCard = React.memo(
  ({ place }: { place: Place }) => {
    return <div>{place.name}</div>;
  },
  (prevProps, nextProps) => {
    return prevProps.place.id === nextProps.place.id;
  }
);
```

### useMemo

```typescript
// ✅ 계산 비용이 큰 값
const sortedPlaces = React.useMemo(() => {
  return places
    .slice()
    .sort((a, b) => b.rating - a.rating);
}, [places]);

// ❌ 간단한 계산
const fullName = React.useMemo(() => {
  return `${firstName} ${lastName}`; // 불필요
}, [firstName, lastName]);
```

### useCallback

```typescript
// ✅ 자식 컴포넌트에 전달하는 함수
const handleSelect = React.useCallback((id: string) => {
  setSelectedId(id);
}, []);

// ❌ 자식에게 전달하지 않는 함수
const handleClick = React.useCallback(() => {
  console.log('clicked'); // 불필요
}, []);
```

## Props 패턴

### 1. Children Pattern

```typescript
type CardProps = {
  children: ReactNode;
};

export function Card({ children }: CardProps) {
  return <div>{children}</div>;
}

// 사용
<Card>
  <Card.Title>Title</Card.Title>
  <Card.Content>Content</Card.Content>
</Card>;
```

### 2. Render Props Pattern

```typescript
type DataFetcherProps<T> = {
  url: string;
  render: (data: T | undefined, isLoading: boolean) => ReactNode;
};

export function DataFetcher<T>({ url, render }: DataFetcherProps<T>) {
  const { data, isLoading } = useQuery({
    queryKey: [url],
    queryFn: () => fetch(url).then(r => r.json() as Promise<T>),
  });

  return <>{render(data, isLoading)}</>;
}

// 사용
<DataFetcher
  url="/places"
  render={(places, isLoading) => (
    isLoading ? <Spinner /> : <PlaceList places={places} />
  )}
/>;
```

### 3. Compound Components

```typescript
type TabsContextValue = {
  activeTab: string;
  setActiveTab: (tab: string) => void;
};

const TabsContext = React.createContext<TabsContextValue | null>(null);

function Tabs({ children }: { children: ReactNode }) {
  const [activeTab, setActiveTab] = React.useState('');
  return (
    <TabsContext.Provider value={{ activeTab, setActiveTab }}>
      <div role="tablist">{children}</div>
    </TabsContext.Provider>
  );
}

function TabList({ children }: { children: ReactNode }) {
  return <div>{children}</div>;
}

function Tab({ value, children }: { value: string; children: ReactNode }) {
  const context = React.useContext(TabsContext);
  if (!context) throw new Error('Tab must be used within Tabs');

  return (
    <button
      role="tab"
      aria-selected={context.activeTab === value}
      onClick={() => context.setActiveTab(value)}
    >
      {children}
    </button>
  );
}

// Namespace로 묶기
Tabs.List = TabList;
Tabs.Tab = Tab;

// 사용
<Tabs>
  <Tabs.List>
    <Tabs.Tab value="search">검색</Tabs.Tab>
    <Tabs.Tab value="ai">AI 추천</Tabs.Tab>
  </Tabs.List>
</Tabs>;
```

## 조건부 렌더링

### Early Return

```typescript
// ✅ Good
function PlaceCard({ place }: PlaceCardProps) {
  if (!place) return null;
  if (place.closed) return null;

  return <div>{place.name}</div>;
}
```

### 삼항 연산자

```typescript
// ✅ 간단한 조건
{isLoading ? <Spinner /> : <PlaceList />}

// ❌ 중첩된 삼항 연산자
{isLoading ? <Spinner /> : error ? <Error /> : <PlaceList />}

// ✅ 여러 조건은 함수로
function getContent() {
  if (isLoading) return <Spinner />;
  if (error) return <Error />;
  return <PlaceList />;
}

{getContent()}
```

### && 연산자

```typescript
// ✅ 단순 표시/숨김
{isLoggedIn && <UserMenu />}
{error && <ErrorBanner />}

// ❌ 숫자는 조심
{places.length && <PlaceList />} // 0이 렌더링됨
{places.length > 0 && <PlaceList />} // ✅
```

## 이벤트 핸들링

### 기본 패턴

```typescript
// ✅ 인라인 (간단한 경우)
<button onClick={() => setCount(count + 1)}>
  Increment
</button>

// ✅ 함수 (복잡한 경우)
const handleSubmit = (e: React.FormEvent<HTMLFormElement>) => {
  e.preventDefault();
  // 복잡한 로직
};

<form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>...</form>;
```

### 파라미터 전달

```typescript
// ✅ 클로저 활용
{places.map(place => (
  <PlaceCard
    key={place.id}
    place={place}
    onSelect={() => handleSelect(place.id)}
  />
))}

// ❌ bind 사용
onSelect={handleSelect.bind(null, place.id)}
```

